@* Wheatfield Kitchen's website (F127.1; three pages since F127.2): home, the menu with its favourites each a card with
   a photo, the children's menu and its wine beside a photo, and a visit page with its hours, where to find it and how
   a table is booked. Every dish, price and fact is one its agent knows. *@
<MockPage Path="/" Label="Home">
    <MockSection Path="/welcome" Heading="A country kitchen in Malmesbury">
        <ChildContent>
            <p>Lunch from Tuesday to Sunday, dinner from Thursday to Saturday, sixty seats inside and on the stoep.</p>
        </ChildContent>
        <Cards>
            <MockCard Path="/welcome/menu" Title="The menu" Opens="/menu">
                Country cooking from the Swartland's own farms.
            </MockCard>
            <MockCard Path="/welcome/visit" Title="Book a table" Opens="/visit">
                When we're open, and how a booking works.
            </MockCard>
        </Cards>
    </MockSection>
</MockPage>
<MockPage Path="/menu" Label="Menu">
    <MockSection Path="/menu/food" Heading="From the kitchen">
        <ChildContent>
            <p>Country cooking from the Swartland's own farms. The kitchen can leave out gluten or dairy on most dishes,
                if you ask when you book.</p>
            <MockMenu>
                <MockCourse Name="Starters">
                    <MockDish Name="Snoek pâté" Price="R85">With farm bread and apricot jam.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Beetroot and feta salad" Price="R80">
                        Roasted beetroot, rocket and walnuts.
                    </MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Soup of the day" Price="R70">With farm bread.</MockDish>
                </MockCourse>
                <MockCourse Name="Mains">
                    <MockDish Name="The Sunday roast" Price="R165">On Sundays, with roast potatoes and gravy.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Lamb shank" Price="R185">Slow-cooked, on mash.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Chicken pie" Price="R125">With a green salad.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Bobotie" Price="R140">With yellow rice and chutney.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Vegetable bake" Price="R115">Vegetarian.</MockDish>
                </MockCourse>
                <MockCourse Name="Puddings">
                    <MockDish Name="Malva pudding" Price="R65">With custard.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Melktert" Price="R55">With cinnamon.</MockDish>
                    <MockDish Name="Ice cream" Price="R45">With chocolate sauce.</MockDish>
                </MockCourse>
            </MockMenu>
        </ChildContent>
        <Cards>
            <MockCard Path="/menu/sunday-roast" Title="The Sunday roast" Note="R165"
                      Photo="images/showroom/wheatfield-roast.webp" />
            <MockCard Path="/menu/lamb-shank" Title="Lamb shank" Note="R185"
                      Photo="images/showroom/wheatfield-lamb.webp" />
            <MockCard Path="/menu/chicken-pie" Title="Chicken pie" Note="R125"
                      Photo="images/showroom/wheatfield-pie.webp" />
            <MockCard Path="/menu/vegetable-bake" Title="Vegetable bake" Note="R115"
                      Photo="images/showroom/wheatfield-bake.webp">Vegetarian.</MockCard>
            <MockCard Path="/menu/malva-pudding" Title="Malva pudding" Note="R65"
                      Photo="images/showroom/wheatfield-malva.webp" />
        </Cards>
    </MockSection>
    <MockSection Path="/menu/children" Heading="For the children">
        <p>A children's menu, each dish R75.</p>
        <MockMenu>
            <MockCourse Name="For the children">
                <MockDish Name="Fish and chips" Price="R75" />
                <MockDish Name="Chicken strips and chips" Price="R75" />
                <MockDish Name="Macaroni cheese" Price="R75" />
            </MockCourse>
        </MockMenu>
    </MockSection>
    <MockSection Path="/menu/wine" Heading="Wine" Photo="images/showroom/wheatfield-wine.webp">
        <p>Wines from the Swartland and the Riebeek Valley, by the glass or the bottle. Corkage R60.</p>
        <p>Not drinking? Rooibos iced tea R35, and filter coffee R30.</p>
    </MockSection>
</MockPage>
<MockPage Path="/visit" Label="Visit">
    <MockSection Path="/visit/hours" Heading="When we're open">
        <p>Open Tuesday to Sunday: lunch 12:00 to 15:00, and dinner 18:00 to 21:30 from Thursday to Saturday. Closed
            Mondays.</p>
    </MockSection>
    <MockSection Path="/visit/find-us" Heading="Find us">
        <p>Sixty seats inside and on the stoep, wheelchair access, and parking behind the restaurant.</p>
    </MockSection>
    <MockSection Path="/visit/book" Heading="Book a table">
        <p>Ask in the chat and the owner confirms your table. Groups of more than twelve, and private functions, by
            arrangement with the owner.</p>
    </MockSection>
</MockPage>
